===Pronunciation===
* {{ang-IPA|sċacan}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb|sċacan}}

# {{lb|ang|intransitive}} to [[pass]] or [[depart]]
# {{lb|ang|intransitive}} to [[quiver]] or [[vibrate]]
# {{lb|ang|transitive}} to [[flourish]] or [[wave]] (an object)
# {{lb|ang|transitive}} to cause something to [[quiver]], [[flutter]], or [[shake]]

